pages.text:
Change any of these in Options > Controls > Key Binds > Xeno Warriors.
- Skills 1-4: {key:skill_ctrl1}, {key:skill_ctrl2}, {key:skill_ctrl3}, {key:skill_ctrl4}
- Ultimate: {key:ultimate_ctrl5}
- KA / super ultimate: {key:super_ultimate_ctrl6}
- Lock on: {key:lock_on}
- Karma Sensing: {key:karma_sense}
- Main menu (stats, party, factions, guide...): {key:stats_menu}
- Transform (Fox King / Demon's Remnants): {key:fox_king}
- Accept / decline a request card: {key:accept_request} / {key:decline_request}
- Hood up / down: {key:toggle_hood}
